	(text "ID grounded (OTG/host cable) -> Q2 off -> R19 pulls EN high -> U3 sources 5V from +5V onto USB2_VBUS. R20 (EVKB R162) is DNP. EVKB R160 (GPIO_AD_07 -> EN) omitted."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 193.04 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "12ac1484-f39f-4320-b2e2-4001282cfc9a")
	)
	(text "shield 100R || 1.5nF to GND (EVKB R1325/C526). SBU1/2 not connected. Chokes: pins 1,3 connector side; 2,4 MCU side."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 231.14 189.23 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "15aef30f-c949-4ef8-96db-0ebf8f610d7b")
	)
	(text "USB1 (OTG1): USB-C device port"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 231.14 38.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "15dc730a-1de2-4f95-b4e9-52579c86ebd4")
	)
	(text "Shield"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 307.34 118.11 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3ad77c30-74fb-4504-93b5-4e69cdf91d8b")
	)
	(text "D+/D- filter + ESD"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 307.34 86.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3d83f6a3-f448-47c3-b574-dc40dc36cb55")
	)
	(text "VBUS switch"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 132.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5604e978-5763-4574-b6a9-ee6e340efdf8")
	)
	(text "+5V is the board 5V rail (EVKB 5V_SYS), to be defined on the power-distribution sheet; PWR_FLAG until then."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 231.14 193.04 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "602ec379-6191-49fc-9655-7762ceef651a")
	)
	(text "USB-C device port: 5.1k CC pull-downs (UFP), VBUS -> 300R bead -> USB1_VBUS sense + 4.7uF, 90R common-mode choke (Murata DLW21HN900SQ2L as EVKB L12/L13, windings 1-2 / 3-4), RClamp0854P ESD (ID pin NC),"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 231.14 185.42 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6761c05a-ae99-429f-83ce-c09aae04d4f9")
	)
	(text "CC / VBUS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 307.34 41.91 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8a5b4cfe-fc64-4332-8c0a-472c0c0c1ed4")
	)
	(text "USB_OTG2_ID -> GPIO_AD_08 (R15) and USB_OTG2_OC -> GPIO_AD_06 (N13), as on the EVKB (R1814/R1999). ILIM 100k (EVKB R142). EVKB D43 VBUS->5V_SYS ORing diode omitted."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 196.85 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9858a05d-6d80-4e3e-976f-c94d7eaf8185")
	)
	(text "USB2 is the HOST port used by USBHost_t36 (USB_OTG2 + USBPHY2); USB1 is the device port (Serial/programming). Replica of MIMXRT1170-EVKB sheet 20, OTG2 half."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 185.42 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a4f7323e-33d3-4662-bf5c-4a07ced165dd")
	)
	(text "ID -> VBUS enable"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 88.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "afd571a4-9974-490c-af40-4e2e2e989997")
	)
	(text "VBUS switching is hardware-only, as the host library drives no GPIO on the RT1176: ID floating (device cable) -> R18 pulls USB_OTG2_ID high -> Q2 on -> EN low -> VBUS off;"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 189.23 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b0b2089c-1109-4afa-8c91-d0d488d792f2")
	)
